  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3371275/israeli-settlers-attack-european-diplomats-beat-french-mayor-west-bank?utm_source=rss_feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">以色列定居者袭击欧洲外交官，殴打法国市长</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Israeli settlers attack European diplomats, beat up French mayor in West Bank</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据报道，一群以色列定居者在约旦河西岸袭击了一支欧洲外交官车队，并对一名法国市长施加了暴力，此事件凸显了该地区持续的紧张局势和对国际观察员的威胁，引发了外交谴责。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/18/2003866157\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">军方将招募平民协助海岸测绘工作</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Military to enlist civilians to map coast</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">为提升海岸线测绘效率和精准度，军方计划招募平民参与相关工作。此举旨在利用社会力量，弥补军事资源不足，同时加强军民合作，对国家地理信息建设具有重要意义。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5pve834grpno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">印度如何危险地沉迷于中国进口商品</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">How India became dangerously addicted to Chinese imports</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">印度经济对中国进口商品的依赖日益加深，这种“上瘾”不仅体现在贸易逆差扩大，更引发了对本国制造业发展和供应链安全的担忧。文章分析了其深层原因和潜在风险。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/12/chinas-hidden-levies-are-becoming-more-visible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国隐性税费的可见度日益提高</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s hidden levies are becoming more visible</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着经济透明度要求的提升和监管力度的加强，中国长期存在的某些隐性税费正变得越来越明晰，这有助于优化营商环境，但也可能对企业运营成本产生影响。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/17/nx-s1-6006773/student-protests-france\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国各地爆发抗议活动，与学生一同发生冲突和纵火</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Scuffles and fires break out as protesters rally across France, joining students</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国多地爆发大规模抗议活动，示威者与学生团体汇合，反对政府的改革政策，期间发生了肢体冲突和纵火事件，反映了社会对当前政策的强烈不满和动荡局势。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/national/2026/10/fight-to-control-congress-washington-week/689050/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">国会控制权之争</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The Fight to Control Congress</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国中期选举后，民主共和两党围绕国会控制权的竞争日趋白热化。双方都力图在参众两院中占据多数席位，这将直接决定未来两年的立法议程和政策走向，对美国政治格局影响深远。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/16/undersea-war-book-review-cables-ocean-gray-zone-tactics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">一场水下“影子战争”正在激烈进行</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">An Underwater Shadow War Is Raging</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">全球地缘政治紧张局势下，各国在深海区域展开秘密行动，进行间谍活动、海底电缆监控和军事部署，这场不宣而战的“影子战争”对国际安全和关键基础设施构成潜在威胁，引发国际社会广泛关注。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/17/trump-russia-waiver-putin-republicans-democrats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普对俄罗斯的制裁豁免引来两党强烈反弹</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump&#x27;s Russia waiver draws instant bipartisan backlash</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国前总统特朗普此前决定豁免对俄罗斯的几项制裁，此举立即引发了国会两党议员的强烈反对和批评，凸显了美国政界在对俄政策上的深刻分歧，并对未来外交走向产生影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxr5yvzv7rp0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"displa