g:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/severe-drought-declared-in-parts-of-united-kingdom/article71588927.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">英国部分地区宣布进入“严重干旱”状态</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;Severe drought&#x27; declared in parts of United Kingdom</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国部分地区已正式宣布进入“严重干旱”状态，这意味着当地将面临水资源短缺的严峻挑战，并可能对农业、环境和居民生活产生深远影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361047887/unacceptable-wallabies-tatters-after-bledisloe-cup-humiliation-all-blacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">布莱迪斯洛杯惨败后，澳大利亚国家橄榄球队“支离破碎”引发强烈不满</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">‘It’s unacceptable’: Wallabies in tatters after Bledisloe Cup humiliation</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚国家橄榄球队在布莱迪斯洛杯中遭遇惨败，表现低迷，导致球队士气瓦解，引发了外界对其表现“不可接受”的强烈批评和广泛担忧，认为其面临严峻的内部和外部挑战。（体育新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/18/double-international-stacey-waaka-inspired-by-honey-for-world-cup-debut/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">双料国手斯泰西·瓦卡受“蜜糖”启发，即将迎来世界杯首秀</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Double international Stacey Waaka inspired by Honey for World Cup debut</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰双料国际运动员斯泰西·瓦卡透露，她从榜样“蜜糖”霍尼·布拉德利身上汲取灵感，为即将到来的橄榄球世界杯首秀做准备。这标志着她职业生涯的重要里程碑，也展现了体育界榜样的影响力。（体育新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/life/music/olivia-dean-shakes-off-western-springs-bowl-hiccup-to-end-on-a-high\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">奥利维亚·迪安克服西部泉水碗场地小插曲，以高潮结束演出</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Olivia Dean shakes off Western Springs Bowl hiccup to end on a high</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">歌手奥利维亚·迪安在西部泉水碗的演出中，虽然开场遭遇小插曲，但她成功调整并最终以精彩表现为活动画上圆满句号，展现了专业素养和现场应变能力，获得了观众的认可。（娱乐新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/17/17-10-sv-coxsbazaar-hotel-blaze-_-bd?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">孟加拉国海滨度假村大火致十人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ten killed in fire at beach resort in Bangladesh</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">孟加拉国一处海滨度假村发生严重火灾，造成至少十人死亡。这起悲剧引发了对度假村安全标准和应急措施的关注，当地政府已展开调查以查明起火原因并防止类似事件再次发生。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/cqdjvxynj2kyo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">南非橄榄球运动员安德鲁斯在球队酒店去世</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">South African rugby player Andrews dies at team hotel</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">南非橄榄球运动员安德鲁斯在球队下榻酒店不幸去世。这一突发事件震惊了南非体育界，具体死因仍在调查中，引发了公众对运动员健康和安全的深切关注。（体育新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmde8dpg8g0no?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">霍尔木兹附近船只遇袭报告达历史新高，石油出口放缓</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ship attack reports near Hormuz reach record high as oil exports slow</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在霍尔木兹海峡附近，船只遇袭的报告数量创下历史新高，导致该区域的石油出口活动显著放缓。这一紧张局势对全球能源市场构成潜在威胁，凸显了中东地区地缘政治冲突对航运安全的影响。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqe8rzg6zl00o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴西亚马逊森林砍伐量创纪录下降，关键大选临近</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Brazil sees record fall in Amazon deforestation as key election looms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴西国家空间研究所数据显示，亚马逊雨林砍伐量创历史新低，同比下降高达66%。此成就发生在即将到来的市政选举前夕，展示了政府在环境政策上的积极成果，可能对选情产生影响。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
